OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with raping
OL,4,A15-year-old girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with raping a
OL,7,F15-year-old girl as she walked near a
OL,8,Frecreation ground.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,11,Fthe teenager was walking near Eccles
OL,12,FRecreation Ground in Salford before she
OL,13,Fwas attacked between 23:00 GMT on 23
OL,14,FOctober and 02:00 on 24 October.
OL,16,FAaron McColl, of Brindleheath Road in
OL,17,FSalford, has been charged with rape and
OL,18,Fsexual assault. The 32-year-old is due
OL,19,Fto appear before Manchester and Salford
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court on Monday.
